[[0,1324813,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-04T10:16:37","INF2020","",[],"<p>My wife was in the shops I got the phonecall from my parents to lay a bet on for the grand national, I got my dad to tell me exactly what to write on the dockets because I haven't a clue about betting slips. I had the money they wanted to lay down in my hand crossed a very busy road on a soaking wet Saturday on my own on a errand from God and was met with a very Irate but well dressed gentleman ordering me not to go into the bookies.</p>\n<p>My mummy and daddy sent me to the shops you'll not block me mate or else I'll kill ya! cat calls verbal abuse traitor? they were on strike. My heads spinning I laid the bets down looked at my hands they're calloused got outside and had the same well dressed gentleman call me a traitor again. Where the fuck were any of yiz when my da got paid of at 57?</p>\n<p>Anyway I told my wife and parents and they were sickened that I crossed a picket line, no cunt blocks access to whatever I need to go into when I'm sent on an errand. My dad was like 'fuck me you didn't' and I'm nonchalant I'd have emptied any cunt that laid a finger on me. My dad told me to never to cross any picket line again, ahm yeah sorry I forgot about democracy and all that shit where the individual has the right to pursue happiness and all that crap without hindrance. </p>\n<p>These liberal fuck cunts that never turned a sod had the gall to call me a traitor and not to go into a certain shop, fuck them all. I need a new avenue of employment I'm thinking strike breaker, what do you think?</p>","Shit post: but I crossed over a picket line and didn't give a fuck","","European"],[1,6479729,0,5,2,3,"2016-10-04T11:20:48","J_Darnley","",[],"<p>I think your accent is so strong you even type it.</p>\n<p>On the strike part I am very much in the &quot;don't like your job, quit&quot; camp. I have no sympathy for people who can take the day off to complain about losing some perk and hinder everyone else from going to work.</p>"],[2,6480558,6479729,2,0,2,"2016-10-04T14:21:29","mHtt","",[],"<p>and this is why retards like you aren't allowed to make important decisions.</p>"],[1,6480419,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-04T13:57:35","Free_Radical","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>ahm yeah sorry I forgot about democracy and all that shit where the individual has the right to pursue happiness and all that crap without hindrance. </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Nothing to do with democracy. Goyim like you who don't understand unity and solidarity will always shank their class compatriots for a few shekels or mere convenience.</p>"],[1,6481597,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-04T16:53:34","LeopoldXXII","",[],"<p>I'm sorry but I've no idea what you're saying. </p>"],[1,6481666,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-04T17:02:35","inquisitor7777","",[],"<p>Just give them a fong up the arse and take flight! Fucking gobshites. If you worked there, maybe they'd have a point. If you are just a punter, then they have no right telling you not to go in.</p>"],[1,6484738,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-04T23:24:05","LiberatedDeathStar","[e]",[],"<p>Damn straight, bubba. Down here in South Carolina, we got all sorts of folks that'll end up going around and doing shit. We fix cars. We cut down trees. We work machinery. Even though I'm in college and probably should be a sheltered fuck like the rest of them, I've still worked my ass off doing shit. I've had to do plenty of real work, and some of it was volunteer work, so I didn't get paid shit for it, let alone picketing around like an asshole. All them liberal fuckwads ain't never worked a real fucking day in their god damn life. &quot;Them illegals are just doing work nobody wants to do.&quot; Fuck you, you sheltered bitch. That &quot;thing nobody wants to do&quot; is just shit <em>you</em> don't want to do. My friends dad was doing that before and now he's fired because of your ass.</p>\n<p>They've never worked a real day in their whole fucking life, which is why they whine about all of this shit. If I had the time, you could pay me to do just about any bit of work. Work is work. I don't care if I'm shoveling horseshit, for minimum wage, I'd at least do it for a while and then go do something else.</p>\n<p>All these fuckers just stand in the way of people trying to get shit done. We have googles (niggers) that do that down here, whining about how they're oppressed and all that bullshit. You stupid porchmonkey, you ain't never done anything in your life, everyone else has to work for a fucking living, and you're now making their life hell.</p>\n<p>I've had a bit to drink now, fellow Anglo across the pond, so I'm okay with throwing around some words like y'all're doing.</p>\n<p>Go strike breaking. Fuck them.</p>"]]
