topped watching at this point.</p>"],[3,6487167,6482954,0,0,0,"2016-10-05T05:28:16","jewsbadnews","",[],"<p>Wow. Why do you think he did this? </p>"],[4,6487229,6487167,1,0,1,"2016-10-05T05:46:07","neogag","",[],"<p>It's speculated that he made some kind of deal behind the scenes.</p>"],[5,6487271,6487229,0,0,0,"2016-10-05T05:58:43","jewsbadnews","",[],"<p>But I thought he was our guy? Do we know who he dealt with?</p>"],[6,6487282,6487271,0,0,0,"2016-10-05T06:00:31","neogag","",[],"<p>No, it's all just speculation.</p>"]]
